#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_post_comment/cohort_post_comment.json:5
msgid ""
"A reply on a cohort post. Replies nest via Parent Comment, and may be "
"anchored to a moment in a video or a passage of Scripture depending on the "
"channel."
msgstr ""
"Una respuesta a una publicación de una cohorte. Las respuestas se anidan "
"mediante el Comentario principal y pueden vincularse a un momento de un "
"video o a un pasaje de las Escrituras, según el canal."

#. Description of a DocType
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_content_flag/cohort_content_flag.json:5
msgid ""
"A report that a post or reply is inappropriate, for a cohort leader or staff "
"to review. Reporting is separate from reacting."
msgstr ""
"Un informe de que una publicación o respuesta es inapropiada, para que un "
"líder de cohorte o un miembro del personal lo revise. Informar es "
"independiente de reaccionar."

#. Description of a DocType
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/transcript_request/transcript_request.json:294
msgid ""
"A request for an official transcript, from the student or the registrar."
msgstr ""

#. Description of a DocType
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/caption_request/caption_request.json:4
msgid ""
"A request for machine-generated captions of an uploaded video. The captions "
"come back as a draft for the instructor to review."
msgstr ""

