#. Description of a DocType
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/withdrawal_reasons/withdrawal_reasons.json:6
msgid ""
"A withdrawal reason is a reusable category explaining why a student "
"withdraws, such as Transfer or Medical Leave. Define reasons here so "
"withdrawals can be tracked and reported, and so students see the right "
"instructions and required documents."
msgstr ""
"Un motivo de retiro es una categoría reutilizable que explica por qué un "
"estudiante se retira, como Traslado o Licencia médica. Defina aquí los "
"motivos para poder realizar el seguimiento y generar informes sobre los "
"retiros, y para que los estudiantes vean las instrucciones correctas y los "
"documentos requeridos."

#. Description of a DocType
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/withdrawal_request/withdrawal_request.json:5
msgid ""
"A withdrawal request records a student leaving a single course, all courses "
"in a term, or an entire program, along with the reason and effective date. "
"Create one to start and process a withdrawal through approval."
msgstr ""
"Una solicitud de baja registra la salida de un estudiante de un solo curso, "
"de todos los cursos de un período académico o de un programa completo, junto "
"con el motivo y la fecha de vigencia. Cree una para iniciar y tramitar una "
"baja mediante el proceso de aprobación."

#: frontend/src/pages/CourseWithdrawalRequest.vue:71
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/CourseWithdrawalRequest-PyPjcVG8.js:1
msgid "A withdrawal request will be created for all your courses this term."
msgstr ""
"Se creará una solicitud de retiro para todos tus cursos en este término."

#. Description of a DocType
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/withdrawal_rules/withdrawal_rules.json:5
msgid ""
"A withdrawal rule defines how a withdrawal is graded on the transcript and "
"whether any refund applies. Create rules such as a clean drop or a W symbol, "
"then assign them to terms to set how late withdrawals are treated."
msgstr ""
"Una regla de retiro define cómo se califica un retiro en el historial "
"académico y si corresponde algún reembolso. Cree reglas como una baja sin "
"consecuencias o un símbolo W y, luego, asígnelas a los períodos académicos "
"para establecer cómo se tratan los retiros tardíos."

