#. Description of the 'Triggers Program Dismissal' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Disciplinary Action'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/disciplinary_action/disciplinary_action.json:37
msgid ""
"When an applied action of this type is recorded on an incident, the student "
"is dismissed from the program through the shared separation spine."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se registra en un incidente una acción aplicada de este tipo, el "
"estudiante es dado de baja del programa a través del eje compartido de "
"separación."

