#. Description of the 'Credit-weighted GPA' (Check) field in DocType 'Program'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/program/program.json
msgid ""
"When checked, GPA is credit-weighted: Σ(points × credits) / Σ(credits). When "
"unchecked, GPA is the simple mean of points across counted rows."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se selecciona, el GPA es ponderado en créditos: (los puntos × "
"créditos) / (créditos). Cuando no se selecciona, el GPA es el medio simple "
"de puntos a través de filas contadas."

#. Description of the 'Require Payment Before Enrollment' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Program'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/program/program.json:430
msgid ""
"When checked, a Course Enrollment in this program lands at 'Awaiting "
"Payment' until the student pays the invoice (or meets the percent below). "
"Forced off for Free Programs."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcado, la inscripción en este programa pasa a \"Esperando "
"pago\" hasta que el estudiante pague la factura (o cumpla el porcentaje de "
"abajo). Forzado para programas gratuitos."

#. Description of the 'Allow Alumni to see Partner Organization Directory?'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json:851
msgid ""
"When checked, alumni see a Partner Organization Directory on their portal."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcada, la persona egresada ve un Directorio de organizaciones "
"asociadas en su portal."

#. Description of the 'Counts in GPA' (Check) field in DocType 'Partner
#. Seminary'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/partner_seminary/partner_seminary.json:104
msgid ""
"When checked, converted grades from this partner participate in the "
"student's GPA. Typically checked for legacy self-referential records, "
"unchecked for external transfer."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcado, las calificaciones convertidas de este socio participan "
"en la GPA del estudiante. Normalmente se comprueba si hay registros de auto "
"referencia heredados, no se marca la transferencia externa."

#. Description of the 'Tracks Capacity' (Check) field in DocType 'Faculty
#. Capability'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/faculty_capability/faculty_capability.json
msgid ""
"When checked, holders declare a capacity (Max Students) for this capability "
"— used for capacity-aware assignment (advising, examining, verifying). Leave "
"off for capabilities without a cap, like Course Instructor or Board/"
"Committee Member."
msgstr ""
"Al marcar esta opción, los titulares declaran una capacidad (Máximo de "
"estudiantes) para esta competencia, que se utiliza para asignaciones en "
"función de la capacidad (asesoramiento, evaluación y verificación). Déjela "
"desmarcada para competencias sin límite, como Instructor del curso o Miembro "
"de la junta/comité."

#. Description of the 'Instructors create Disciplinary Incident' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json:839
msgid ""
"When checked, on each course there will be actions to report disciplinary "
"incidents, at the course and assessment levels. A second gate on the "
"disciplinary reason applies, so only when both conditions are met such type "
"of reporting can occur."
msgstr ""
"Al marcar esta opción, en cada curso habrá acciones para informar de "
"incidentes disciplinarios, tanto a nivel del curso como de la evaluación. Se "
"aplica un segundo filtro basado en el motivo disciplinario, por lo que este "
"tipo de informe solo puede realizarse cuando se cumplen ambas condiciones."

#. Description of the 'Track Attendance for Online Meetings' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json
msgid ""
"When checked, online meetings are attendance-bearing (students can check "
"in / instructors mark them, and they count toward each course's scheduled-"
"meeting total). Uncheck to make online meetings calendar-only — excluded "
"from check-in, instructor marking, and the absence-limit math. (A fully "
"online section can instead set its Attendance Policy to Disabled.)"
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcada, las reuniones en línea cuentan para la asistencia (los "
"estudiantes pueden registrarse y los instructores pueden marcar la "
"asistencia, y estas reuniones cuentan para el total de reuniones programadas "
"de cada curso). Desmárquela para que las reuniones en línea solo figuren en "
"el calendario: quedarán excluidas del registro de asistencia, de la "
"marcación por parte del instructor y del cálculo del límite de ausencias. "
"(Una sección completamente en línea puede establecer, en su lugar, su "
"Política de asistencia como Deshabilitada.)"

#. Description of the 'Enforce meeting time window' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json
msgid ""
"When checked, self check-in is time-based: the system auto-selects the "
"meeting happening now (within the window below) and optionally requires a "
"code — best when your site Time Zone (System Settings) matches the seminary. "
"When unchecked, students instead pick any past meeting they have no "
"attendance for (no clock dependency)."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcada, la autoidentificación de asistencia se basa en la hora: "
"el sistema selecciona automáticamente la reunión que está teniendo lugar en "
"ese momento (dentro del intervalo indicado abajo) y, opcionalmente, solicita "
"un código; funciona mejor cuando la zona horaria de su sitio (Configuración "
"del sistema) coincide con la del seminario. Cuando no está marcada, los "
"estudiantes seleccionan cualquier reunión pasada a la que no tengan "
"asistencia registrada (sin depender del reloj)."

#. Description of the 'Require Staff Verification of Course Enrollments'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Program'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/program/program.json:461
msgid ""
"When checked, students can only create a Draft enrollment for this program; "
"a registrar must apply Submit before the student can pay. When unchecked, "
"the student's enrollment auto-submits to Awaiting Payment."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se selecciona, los estudiantes sólo pueden crear una inscripción en "
"Drraft para este programa; un registrador debe aplicar Enviar antes de que "
"el estudiante pueda pagar. Cuando no está marcado, la inscripción del "
"estudiante se envía automáticamente a Esperando el pago."

#. Description of the 'Students Can Request Graduation' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Program'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/program/program.json:186
msgid ""
"When checked, students may file a Graduation Request from the audit page. "
"Uncheck for programs where graduation is fully registrar-driven."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se selecciona, los estudiantes pueden presentar una Solicitud de "
"graduación desde la página de auditoría. Anule la selección para los "
"programas cuya graduación sea gestionada íntegramente por la secretaría "
"académica."

#. Description of the 'Require check-in code' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json:676
msgid ""
"When checked, students must enter the chapel's human-readable check-in code "
"(shown to the chaplain on the Chapel record, to display on screen during the "
"service) to mark attendance."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcada, los estudiantes deben introducir el código de registro "
"de asistencia legible de la capilla (que se muestra al capellán en el "
"registro de la capilla para visualizarlo en pantalla durante el servicio) "
"para registrar su asistencia."

#. Description of the 'Require check-in code' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json:697
msgid ""
"When checked, students must enter the meeting's human-readable check-in code "
"to self-record course attendance. The code is generated on demand from the "
"attendance page (\"Show check-in code\")."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se marca, los estudiantes deben introducir el código de registro "
"legible de la reunión para registrar por sí mismos su asistencia al curso. "
"El código se genera a demanda desde la página de asistencia (\"Mostrar "
"código de registro\")."

#. Description of the 'Allow students to request course enrollment on Portal'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json:556
msgid ""
"When checked, students will have access to Enrollment page listing only "
"courses available for their program, which they have not yet taken. They "
"will be able to cancel the enrollment before it is submitted."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se selecciona, los estudiantes tendrán acceso a la página de "
"inscripción que sólo incluye los cursos disponibles para su programa, los "
"cuales aún no han tomado. Podrán cancelar la inscripción antes de que se "
"presente."

#. Description of the 'Allow students to request course withdrawal on Portal'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json:523
msgid ""
"When checked, students will see the withdrawal dates for the course (defined "
"per academic term) and have a button to request course withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se selecciona, los estudiantes verán las fechas de retiro del curso "
"(definidas por término académico) y tendrán un botón para solicitar la "
"retirada del curso."

#. Description of the 'Blocks Graduation Request' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Graduation Requirement Item'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/graduation_requirement_item/graduation_requirement_item.json:61
msgid ""
"When checked, the student cannot file a Graduation Request until this "
"requirement is Fulfilled or Waived. Use for items the school treats as a "
"hard prerequisite (recommendation letters, theses)."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se selecciona, el estudiante no puede presentar una solicitud de "
"graduación hasta que este requisito se complete o se supere. Utilizar para "
"artículos que la escuela trata como un requisito previo duro (cartas de "
"recomendación, estos)."

#. Description of the 'Available to Instructors on Portal' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Disciplinary Action'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/disciplinary_action/disciplinary_action.json:55
msgid ""
"When checked, this action will be available for instructors to perform and "
"report. Useful for verbal warnings that don't need escalation."
msgstr ""
"Al marcarse, esta acción estará disponible para que los instructores la "
"realicen y registren. Es útil para advertencias verbales que no requieren "
"una escalada."

#. Description of the 'Answered' (Check) field in DocType 'Cohort Post'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_post/cohort_post.json:134
msgid ""
"When checked, this request moves out of the active prayer list into Answered "
"prayers."
msgstr ""
"Al marcar esta opción, esta solicitud pasa de la lista activa de oraciones a "
"Oraciones respondidas."

#. Description of the 'Registrar can record attendance and open gradebooks'
#. (Check) field in DocType 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json:745
msgid ""
"When checked, users with the Registrar role can record attendance and open "
"course gradebooks, in addition to teaching staff. Turn this off if the "
"person acting as registrar is also a student or should not see grades."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está activado, los usuarios con el rol de registrador pueden "
"registrar la asistencia y abrir los libros de calificaciones de los cursos, "
"además del personal docente. Desactívelo si la persona que actúa como "
"registrador también es estudiante o no debería ver las calificaciones."

#. Description of the 'Forms Community Cohorts' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Course'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/course/course.json:142
msgid ""
"When enabled, this course can seed discipleship community cohorts from its "
"student groups (e.g. Spiritual Formation courses)."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, este curso puede crear cohortes de comunidades de "
"discipulado a partir de sus grupos de estudiantes (p. ej., cursos de "
"Formación espiritual)."

#. Description of the 'Meeting reminders' (Table) field in DocType 'Cohort
#. Type'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_type/cohort_type.json:307
msgid "When members are reminded of a meeting. No rows: no reminders."
msgstr ""

#. Description of the 'Flexible Dates' (Check) field in DocType 'Internship
#. Position'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/internship_position/internship_position.json:169
msgid "When off, give preferred start/end dates."
msgstr ""
"Cuando esté desactivado, indique las fechas de inicio y finalización "
"preferidas."

#. Description of the 'Students may contact me' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Instructor'
#: frontend/src/components/ProfileModal.vue:258
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/index-Bfq_UJQ8.js:1
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/instructor/instructor.json:162
msgid ""
"When off, only staff can reach you through the portal; students see no "
"contact icons on your courses."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está desactivada, solo el personal puede ponerse en contacto contigo "
"a través del portal; los estudiantes no ven iconos de contacto en tus cursos."

#. Description of the 'Open to Cohort Invitations' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Alumni Profile'
#: seminary/alumni/doctype/alumni_profile/alumni_profile.json:128
msgid ""
"When off, other alumni cannot invite this person into a community cohort "
"from the portal. Staff can still seat them."
msgstr ""
"Si está desactivado, otros exalumnos no pueden invitar a esta persona a una "
"cohorte comunitaria desde el portal. El personal aún puede asignarle un "
"lugar."

